From a6a2edbaa2dedaa9d5d91905513f43123a96db99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thor-rebase <thor@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:32:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 30/31] fix: rebase PR 1856 onto v26.04 + niri-tablet gesture
 series

Resolutions required to land the per-device touch/tablet config on top of
the gesture stack and the v26.04 base:

- Tablet/Tablets keep upstream's map-to-focused-output: honour it in
  output_for_tablet() alongside the new name-keyed lookup, and carry the
  field in the default Tablet literal and the parse snapshot.
- DEFAULT_TABLET becomes a static: a const with a Vec field cannot be
  returned by Tablets::find().
- libinput::device.name() now yields Cow<str>; deref it at the
  tablets/touch_screens lookup sites.
- Keep upstream's output_exists() guard in compute_tablet_position while
  binding the device once (PR 1856's change).
- Keep sync_touch_debug_log() ahead of the 'static-bounded
  on_touch_down().
---
 niri-config/src/input.rs | 14 ++++++++++++--
 src/input/mod.rs         |  4 ++--
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

